AUDIO
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

web/audio/ holds five short spoken prompts used by the Ask the Docent
interface ("no direct answer", and so on). They are speech synthesised from
text written for this project, so they fall under the CC BY grant above with
the text they were made from. No recorded human voice, oral history or
interview audio is distributed in this repository.

