VIDEO
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

No video is distributed in this repository.

The catalogue RECORDS in corpora/videos.jsonl — titles, descriptions,
categories, tags and ordering — were written for this project and ARE covered
by the CC BY grant above.

The VIDEO those records point at is NOT. Of the 99 records, 97 point at
YouTube and 2 at this project's own object storage. Each record carries its own
rights_status and rights_note: 89 are marked not_required, 10 granted. Video is
shown only where rights have been confirmed or are not required.

Nothing in this licence grants any rights in any third-party video. Reusing a
record is not permission to reuse the video it names.

Descriptions in that catalogue are ours. Where a description had been copied
from a channel's own YouTube text, the copied part — contact details, links and
calls to action — was removed rather than published under our licence.
